{"recordFormat":"standalone-source-scientific-candidate-v1","recordId":"chemie-current439-source9-HB97-independent-b-20261017-v1.source-03","runId":"chemie-current439-source9-HB97-independent-b-20261017-v1","caseId":"CURRENT-SOURCE-03","sourceGoalId":"bw-chem-sekii-3-4-8-b04-a01-51bba460","jurisdiction":"DE-BW","verdict":"accepted","verdictScope":"Only this exact current operative source row, with the complete mapped current target closure and explicit official qualifiers; machine candidate only","findingIds":[],"qualifierAndBroaderTargetBoundary":"BW Leistungsfach; one further selected family. Dyes carry complete historical/current/future research duty; other listed families are examples, and extra target duties remain broader SkillPilot scope. No learner selection inferred.","frozenScientificReasoning":"## CURRENT-SOURCE-03 — BW — ACCEPTED, bounded to one selected family in Leistungsfach\n\nSource key: `bw-chem-sekii-3-4-8-b04-a01-51bba460`.\n\nActual official physical page 42 / printed 40, section 3.4.8(4), requires application-oriented research and development for **one further selected substance family**, connecting historical, current and future perspectives. It belongs to classes 11/12 Leistungsfach. The example list is not a requirement to teach every listed family.\n\nThe full union is a78aacf9 (detergent components), e56040b5 (silicone cluster with a96e9b3d and 6413429b), f71a2c0a (analgesic chemistry), fa21e8e1 (whole dye subtree), and d815960a (research over time). The historical/current/future duty is explicitly and coherently carried by `d815960a-21ab-5a42-8b23-ecd20d03db19`, using the selected family **dyes**. BW-B1 links historical indigo manufacture to redox/solubility use and a prospective U/V process comparison; BW-B2 connects historical process development, A/B structure/performance evidence and a testable C research question. They distinguish established historical information, invented present-project data and future hypotheses. This is more than an assortment of molecule facts.\n\nThe other mapped topics supply partial context, not independent complete fulfilment of the research-over-time duty. Full mechanistic azo/triphenylmethane routes, vat-dyeing performance, all detergent ingredients, all analgesics and both silicone atoms are **broader SkillPilot target duties**, not all universal requirements of 3.4.8(4). The current explicit d815 entry is in BW LK and absent from BW GK. Acceptance is for a complete union with this allocation and explicit qualifier, not equivalence of every mapped atom to the entire source, not a claim that a particular learner selected dyes, and not whole-BW approval.\n","rawFirstPin":{"path":"/mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/current439-source9-HB97-fresh-independent-b-v1/FIRST.independent-Source9-HB97.scientific.frozen.md","sha256":"b577d5418ad784c6c0f2fd2a7a26e1b90ffea34cfc935034f1f308e7e3d920d3","bytes":21541},"wholeOperativeSourceGoalDigest":"sha256:9075f3c17ab6b064df62d79d8e8ac746362704ffae518b7efa15ce4a9cd93ee5","wholePassagesDigest":"sha256:b47c06aa317e07f370b2372b830e8e2201afe442ffe654f7be1a1624cdb6294a","currentMappingInputDigest":"sha256:c0fc02272a529b72f32a90b2df159f010d756fceebcad7e4a7dc47106ac9b5e0","wholeCaseInputDigest":"sha256:5ad2b8135ceef5d6db9f747955775f28bcde0f5ea9264331791e92a3daf59bd4","scienceProjectionPin":{"path":"/mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/current439-source9-HB97-whole-union-neutral-review-preparation-technical-v1/REVIEW.current-source9-whole-union-HB97.whole-scientific-inputs.no-old-verdicts.json","sha256":"dd7b8f863c4b1796d5abe37a25728c5e91bdea6d3c0cbc0e5e8764c610d42a48","bytes":2667378},"sourceExtractionPins":[{"path":"/mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/current439-remediation14-guarded-root-integration-technical-v1/capsule/curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-10/chemie-q3-three-BW-source-adoption-technical-successor-20261010-v1/sources/whole-BW126-original-operative-document-contract.exact.json","sha256":"8dfeb68b49e9b9